OL,3,GNEWSAJudgment reserved in appeal over
OL,4,ASean Brown murder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK Supreme Court has reserved
OL,7,Fjudgment in an attempt by the
OL,8,Fgovernment to overturn a ruling which
OL,9,Fordered a public inquiry into the
OL,10,Fmurder of Gaelic Athletic Association
OL,11,F(GAA) official Sean Brown.
OL,13,FBrown, 61, was abducted in Bellaghy,
OL,14,FCounty Londonderry, and shot by the
OL,15,FLoyalist Volunteer Force (LVF) in 1997.
OL,17,FIntelligence material has since linked
OL,18,Fstate agents to his murder.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
