OL,3,GNEWSAJudgment reserved in appeal over
OL,4,ASean Brown murder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing in London lasted almost
OL,7,Ffive hours, after which the court said
OL,8,Fit would deliver a judgement as soon as
OL,9,Fit could.
